	(text "proto-s32k344:\n - S32K344 in 172 pin HDQFP package\n - TJA1101B ethernet t1 phy\n - XR21 usb uart\n - 5V, 3.3V, and 1.5V LDO power supplies\n - 20-pin ETM/TRACE\n"
